@startuml
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
title Moderated LMS v1.0 - UML Deployment Diagram
node "School Windows computer" as host {
  node "Windows operating system" {
    artifact "lms.exe
Qt 6 Widgets desktop client" as app
    artifact "Qt runtime DLLs +
platform plugin" as runtime
    database "SQLite file
%APPDATA%\LMS\lms.db" as db
    folder "Existing submission files
(path references)" as files
  }
}
actor "Administrator / Lecturer /
HoD / Student" as users
users --> app : local GUI interaction
app --> runtime : uses
app --> db : parameterised SQL
app --> files : stores and opens paths
note bottom of host
Offline deployment. One local application instance;
no application server or internet required.
end note
@enduml
